      "rationale": "P022 supplies the assessed outcomes; P030 and P031 supply the exposure, coverage and assessment limits. P014 identifies the safety bounds."
    }
  },
  "stated_empirical_relation": {
    "component_id": "C068_stated_empirical_relation",
